		(descr "Worldsemi WS2815B-V1, 5050 PLCC6, 12 V addressable RGB LED with a backup data input. Land pattern and pin-out from datasheets/led/WS2815B-V1.pdf p.2 (Solder Pad; PIN Configuration, top view): pads 1.5 x 1.0 at 1.6 pitch, 3.4 between the columns inner edges; left column 4 DIN1, 5 GND, 6 DIN2, right column 3 DO, 2 VDD, 1 NC, top to bottom. The body chamfer (C0.9) is at pin 4, not pin 1: the filled silk triangle marks that corner, outside the body so it shows in an assembler's placement preview")
